    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B01b2 scope (RBAC, security, tenant IdP)","items":["Completes B01 auth/identity split. Modules: rbac (~22 routes est.), security-policy (2), tenant-idp-config (8).","RBAC: /admin/rbac/roles CRUD/clone/members/policy links; /admin/rbac/policies CRUD/validate; /users/me/permission-checks and /users/:id/permission-checks (single/bulk).","Security policy: GET/PUT /admin/security/policy. Tenant IdP config: CRUD + POST :id/test, PUT :id/directory-credentials, POST :id/sync under /admin/tenant-idp-config."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Example input/output (representative)","items":["Role/policy create/update: role/policy DTOs (name, permissions/policy document, metadata) -> role/policy responses; clone creates derived role.","Permission check: action/subject/resource context -> allow/deny decision result (and bulk array for bulk endpoint).","Security policy: GET returns effective policy; PUT accepts policy payload and returns updated/effective policy.","Tenant IdP config: create/update IdP config DTO (provider/protocol/metadata) -> config response; test/sync return operation/test results. Directory credentials are managed via dedicated PUT endpoint. Verify exact DTO schemas."]},
